Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?MIDI:=20visual=20mapper=20=E2=80=94=20bind=20co?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ntrols=20by=20clicking=20a=20picture=20of=20the=20controller.?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20Principle=20VII.?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a Visual Mapper window, opened from the MIDI Mapping dialog, that draws
the controller from a JSON layout with each control's bound function above
it. Click a control (or touch it on the hardware) and pick its function; the
list offers only functions that control can drive. Edits go straight into
the live bindings and midi.settings, so the table and picture stay in sync.

- core: MidiControllerLayout parser with boundary validation
- resources: Hercules DJControl MP3 e2 / MP3 LE / Glow layout
- gui: MidiControllerCanvas, MidiVisualMapperDialog, Visual Mapper button
- optional operator photo behind the drawing
- test: midi_controller_layout_test
- docs: "Using the visual mapper"

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FBP7mB64FKo2WyaAr8ZSRx
